---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | SITA RAM Initiatives" description="Privacy information for SITA RAM Initiatives.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-hero__inner"><h1>Privacy</h1><p class="lede">This page explains the default privacy posture for this website.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container prose">
    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>This static website does not require a database. If contact, RSVP or registration links are added, they may send visitors to external services identified at the point of use.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>Analytics are optional and should be configured only when the organization supplies the relevant measurement ID. Analytics failures must not block website access.</p>
    <h2>External Links</h2>
    <p>Some links may lead to the main GOPAL Foundation website, video platforms or registration forms. Those services may have their own privacy practices.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
